[00:00.52] in the dead of your eyes
[00:03.38] we will hold each other tight
[00:06.20] in the graveyard at night as we die
[00:11.48] all alone in the cold
[00:14.58] where no one else will go
[00:17.06] we will sing of a life less defined
[00:23.40] and any thoughts of preservation are left there to bleed
[00:29.36] torn asunder from creation
[01:04.46] nothing left but our deeds
